WEBVTT

00:00:01.592 --> 00:00:07.056
The wife's name is Eris, and the
husband's name is Kakazu Kio.

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:09.808
These two ordinary people
share an ordinary love,

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:12.228
and had an ordinary marriage.

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:14.730
But the one thing that was different was,

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:17.900
the wife was an alien.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.409
Mitaiken na no

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:33.207
Me no mae ni kotae wa iroiro aru kedo

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:40.422
Hitotsu no oozora wo nan toubun dekiru?

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.299
Tanoshii kara subete wo kudasai

00:00:42.383 --> 00:00:44.051
atashi tteba dokusen shitai

00:00:44.134 --> 00:00:47.513
Honne ga koboreru yo Blue sky

00:00:47.596 --> 00:00:55.229
Mou! Namae wo kaite okou kienai you ni

00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:57.022
Shinken ni nattara?

00:00:57.106 --> 00:01:02.278
Sou you no yada nante iwasenai

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:08.993
Jun'ai souchi (Set up now) ugokidase

00:01:09.076 --> 00:01:13.080
Aseri to yume no kassouro

00:01:13.163 --> 00:01:16.959
Shiitoberuto wa motto gyutto itashite

00:01:17.042 --> 00:01:23.841
Saishinsouchi (Back up now) ugokidasu

00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:27.886
Anata no kokoro dake wa

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:31.599
orijinaru ga hoshikute

00:01:31.682 --> 00:01:35.603
sakusen tatemashita yo

00:01:40.024 --> 00:01:43.819
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:01:59.418 --> 00:02:01.670
Shojo manga, huh?

00:02:03.172 --> 00:02:05.257
"Tho timo is at hand"

00:02:05.549 --> 00:02:09.178
The time? Oh, no! I'm going to be late!

00:02:11.221 --> 00:02:14.266
Summer vacation was over, and as of today,

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:17.311
the second semester
had begun for the students.

00:02:21.273 --> 00:02:23.150
Another sunny day!

00:02:24.568 --> 00:02:26.737
Now then,
before our opening ceremony,

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:29.365
I'd like to introduce
a new transfer student.

00:02:29.448 --> 00:02:31.241
Come on in.

00:02:40.042 --> 00:02:44.588
This is Eris, the alien who will
be studying with us as of today.

00:02:44.588 --> 00:02:45.464
"Assistroids" "Eris" This is Eris, the alien
who will be studying with us as of today.

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:46.298
"Assistroids" "Eris"

00:02:46.715 --> 00:02:49.593
| still don't know a lot about Earth,

00:02:49.677 --> 00:02:52.012
but I am pleased to
make your acquaintance.

00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:55.140
Eris, why...?

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.310
Shore duty sure is nice.

00:02:58.394 --> 00:03:03.315
It sure is nice, being on
the ground. It's so comforting.

00:03:03.399 --> 00:03:06.777
So anyway, Qoone,
about Eris going to school...

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.529
Oh, that? I felt sorry for her,

00:03:08.612 --> 00:03:11.323
having her mating season cut
short, so I approved it.

00:03:11.407 --> 00:03:15.244
| knew it. But she was
unusually serious about it.

00:03:15.327 --> 00:03:17.371
She seemed to accept it at face value

00:03:17.454 --> 00:03:19.915
that she was surveying
an educational institution.

00:03:19.998 --> 00:03:22.793
She is kind of bumble-headed
when it comes to that.

00:03:22.876 --> 00:03:24.962
There's a lot going on around her, too,

00:03:25.045 --> 00:03:28.340
so it's hard for her and Kio
to be alone together.

00:03:28.424 --> 00:03:30.634
You mean Aoi and Manami?

00:03:30.718 --> 00:03:33.345
If only it were just them.

00:03:34.722 --> 00:03:35.889
Antonia...

00:03:35.973 --> 00:03:37.015
Lirimonie...

00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:38.225
Norfederas...

00:03:38.308 --> 00:03:39.977
Papanorgas...

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:43.647
Arecroteles Cnorses Morfenoss.

00:03:43.731 --> 00:03:45.941
Since I am not quite
accustomed to this country,

00:03:46.024 --> 00:03:48.235
| would ask for your regards.

00:03:48.318 --> 00:03:50.320
Antonia...

00:03:50.404 --> 00:03:52.281
She followed you here, Eris.

00:03:52.364 --> 00:03:54.491
Is this right? A world-class millionaire like her

00:03:54.575 --> 00:03:56.285
coming to our backwater school?

00:03:56.368 --> 00:03:58.078
Won't there be a big to-do
if something happens?

00:03:58.162 --> 00:03:59.413
Look.

00:03:59.788 --> 00:04:04.877
American Department of
Justice NIJ-0108.01 standard

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.755
Level Il bulletproof glass.

00:04:07.838 --> 00:04:09.757
She's pulled some strings.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.718
In addition, look. Bodyguards, too.

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:16.388
Antonia's friends, Maya and Sara.

00:04:16.472 --> 00:04:20.893
My lady, exactly what
purpose is there to this bread?

00:04:20.976 --> 00:04:24.772
They have this custom for
transfer students in this country.

00:04:24.855 --> 00:04:28.484
| see. You are indeed most knowledgeable.

00:04:28.567 --> 00:04:32.654
If I may ask, where might you
have heard about this behavior?

00:04:32.738 --> 00:04:36.700
It was written in a book,
marked as "shojo manga."

00:04:38.076 --> 00:04:38.827
"I'm gonna be late!I"

00:04:38.827 --> 00:04:39.661
"I'm gonna be late!!"
That was in there, all right.

00:04:39.661 --> 00:04:41.121
That was in there, all right.

00:04:53.467 --> 00:04:55.010
What's the matter, Kio?

00:04:55.093 --> 00:04:59.556
Oh, I'm just not used to
getting so much attention.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:03.602
Is that right? Well we
can't have that, can we?

00:05:08.357 --> 00:05:10.400
Is that better, Miss Eris?

00:05:10.484 --> 00:05:11.944
Y-Yes...

00:05:13.111 --> 00:05:14.696
Hey, Kio!

00:05:15.864 --> 00:05:17.241
Are you--

00:05:18.534 --> 00:05:21.620
It's all right! They're in my club!

00:05:24.164 --> 00:05:25.874
We'd heard all the rumors,

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.126
but you really do live a
rough-and-tumble life, huh?

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.837
Sorry, President.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.422
So then, are you going to
be able to come to the camp?

00:05:32.506 --> 00:05:34.591
Are you all going some place?

00:05:34.675 --> 00:05:36.593
The video club has a camp.

00:05:36.677 --> 00:05:38.804
How about it?
Do you want to come, too?

00:05:38.887 --> 00:05:40.681
Yes, I'd like to go.

00:05:40.764 --> 00:05:43.934
You do? Well,
fill out this club entry form.

00:05:44.935 --> 00:05:46.395
We'll take some, as well.

00:05:46.478 --> 00:05:50.357
The lady wishes to join
the same club as Miss Eris.

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:51.984
P-President!

00:05:52.067 --> 00:05:53.360
Please give one to us, as well.

00:05:53.443 --> 00:05:55.362
Huh? M-Manami...

00:05:55.445 --> 00:05:57.281
"Ploase”
"Wanna join"

00:05:57.573 --> 00:06:01.702
This is amazing, President!
Our girl membership just shot up!

00:06:01.785 --> 00:06:02.911
Uh-huh.

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:05.330
We didn't have to join, too.

00:06:05.414 --> 00:06:07.249
Are you sure, even when Eris is joining?

00:06:07.332 --> 00:06:11.378
She'll start having
more time together with Kio.

00:06:12.629 --> 00:06:15.591
Camping... with Kakazu...

00:06:27.019 --> 00:06:31.481
Whoa! That's a rice rocket
for you! The pickup is awesome!

00:06:31.565 --> 00:06:33.108
You like it, then?

00:06:33.191 --> 00:06:36.486
Thank you, Mariko. Oh, yeah...

00:06:42.451 --> 00:06:43.827
Shit!

00:06:55.505 --> 00:06:57.299
Good morning, everyone!

00:06:58.425 --> 00:07:01.470
Ah, good morning, Kakazu.

00:07:01.553 --> 00:07:03.138
What's wrong?

00:07:07.935 --> 00:07:09.978
| thought we were going by bus.

00:07:10.062 --> 00:07:13.106
If you mean a long, stretched-out
vehicle, then you're right.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.816
Calling all squads,

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.527
stand by at current
stations until further orders.

00:07:18.612 --> 00:07:20.072
We're now assigning cars.

00:07:20.155 --> 00:07:22.491
All units, follow your
division leader's instructions.

00:07:22.574 --> 00:07:24.910
Seat five people in each car.

00:07:24.993 --> 00:07:26.536
Are you sure about this, Teacher?

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.789
The higher-ups said to suit ourselves.

00:07:29.706 --> 00:07:33.001
Why do people like this
only show up under my charge?

00:07:33.085 --> 00:07:35.545
Where's the harm?
Our food and travel are free,

00:07:35.629 --> 00:07:36.421
and we have pretty
maids taking care of us.

00:07:36.421 --> 00:07:38.465
"Please toll us™" "Where should we goat in?"
"Where?" and we have pretty maids taking care of us.

00:07:38.465 --> 00:07:39.257
"Please tall us" "Where
should we gat in?" "Where?"

00:07:39.758 --> 00:07:44.888
Divide up among all the cars.
Also, I'm sorry to ask this,

00:07:44.972 --> 00:07:46.932
but one of you go with her.

00:07:48.141 --> 00:07:49.601
--Riding with... a kitty...

00:07:49.601 --> 00:07:51.395
--Move out!
--Riding with... a kitty...

00:07:56.233 --> 00:08:00.529
You know, Futaba and Kinjoh,
I'm glad you joined the club.

00:08:00.612 --> 00:08:05.617
Arisa and I were the only girls,
so we felt a little stigmatized.

00:08:05.701 --> 00:08:08.453
Well, for us, it's just our job.

00:08:08.537 --> 00:08:10.664
But it must be pretty tough, huh?

00:08:10.747 --> 00:08:14.334
You two are both after him, right?

00:08:14.418 --> 00:08:16.962
You can try to play dumb, but we can tell.

00:08:17.045 --> 00:08:19.715
You two are both after Kio, right?

00:08:20.549 --> 00:08:22.968
G-Geez, what are you talking about?

00:08:23.051 --> 00:08:25.345
He and I are just
friends from when we were little.

00:08:25.429 --> 00:08:28.056
If anything, Aoi is the
one who has her sights on Kio.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.266
M-Manami!

00:08:29.349 --> 00:08:30.976
Yeah, we knew it.

00:08:31.059 --> 00:08:33.020
W-Why are you buying that?

00:08:33.103 --> 00:08:35.856
Manami, you're mistaken,
you're mistaken!

00:08:35.939 --> 00:08:37.524
T-Take it easy, Aoi.

00:08:37.607 --> 00:08:41.069
Still, Futaba, a lot of
people have seen you and Kio

00:08:41.153 --> 00:08:43.697
chatting it up at HNV.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:48.535
What's more, Kio is
pretty popular among the girls.

00:08:48.618 --> 00:08:52.039
But he's nerdy, and wears glasses,
and is so wishy-washy!

00:08:52.122 --> 00:08:54.750
He's a guy who could live on
cup noodles for all three meals!

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:58.462
Nowadays, nerdiness
falls under individuality.

00:08:59.504 --> 00:09:03.008
He's sweet, and kind, and always decent.

00:09:03.091 --> 00:09:06.136
His potential to shine
with a little work is quite high.

00:09:07.137 --> 00:09:11.183
But it must make you anxious,
having an alien as a rival.

00:09:11.266 --> 00:09:16.104
To nerds, an alien with kitty ears
is like a cat guarding the milk.

00:09:16.188 --> 00:09:19.066
Though it'd be hard
to tell which one is the cat.

00:09:20.942 --> 00:09:23.403
Intelligent, living cheelas,
residing in a neutron star!

00:09:23.487 --> 00:09:26.406
Fantastic! Now that's an alien!

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.283
She's fallen asleep.

00:09:28.366 --> 00:09:30.702
She seemed so thrilled to be going out

00:09:30.786 --> 00:09:32.788
together with you, Miss Eris,

00:09:32.871 --> 00:09:35.165
that she was up all night.

00:09:36.792 --> 00:09:39.753
She's really been
looking forward to this, huh?

00:09:39.836 --> 00:09:43.924
Yes. It's been a long time
since I've seen the lady like this.

00:09:44.007 --> 00:09:46.259
And Sara, as well.

00:09:46.343 --> 00:09:49.179
Little kitty, are you too cold?

00:09:49.721 --> 00:09:51.098
"I'm fino"

00:09:51.765 --> 00:09:54.518
Great! That's great!

00:09:56.228 --> 00:09:59.981
Sara became an irrelevant bodyguard,
as she rode off on her own.

00:10:03.026 --> 00:10:04.861
This is the tenth incident.

00:10:04.945 --> 00:10:09.157
A computer, a TV,
a cell phone, and a DVD player.

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:13.787
Good grief, all they
took were the new devices.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:16.039
Could it be a ring of child thieves?

00:10:16.123 --> 00:10:18.959
You'd have to be a kindergartener
or smaller to get in that window.

00:10:19.042 --> 00:10:21.461
It's also weird that they
didn't even touch the money,

00:10:21.545 --> 00:10:23.713
and only stole the electronic goods.

00:10:23.797 --> 00:10:26.842
This is the work of a kijimuna.

00:10:26.925 --> 00:10:28.802
A kijimuna, huh?

00:10:28.885 --> 00:10:31.555
Should we get some five-inch nails ready?

00:10:38.603 --> 00:10:40.564
--Cat Planet Cuties.
--Cat Planet Cuties.

00:10:51.449 --> 00:10:53.118
It's so pretty!

00:10:54.244 --> 00:10:56.037
Well then, shall we pitch the tents?

00:10:56.121 --> 00:10:58.290
We'll need a place
to change into our swimsuits.

00:10:58.373 --> 00:10:59.499
Swimsuits?

00:10:59.583 --> 00:11:01.418
What do you mean?
We didn't hear about this!

00:11:01.501 --> 00:11:04.337
This is the video club camp, right?

00:11:04.421 --> 00:11:06.631
We'll practice our shooting, as well.

00:11:06.715 --> 00:11:09.384
But half of this is camp, after all.

00:11:09.467 --> 00:11:12.012
Why didn't you mention this first?!

00:11:12.095 --> 00:11:14.055
Well, you joined the club so suddenly!

00:11:14.139 --> 00:11:16.683
Ow-w-w, that hurts, Manami!

00:11:17.767 --> 00:11:21.897
W-Whatever. A girl has to
get these things ready, you know.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:25.233
Geez, you're as rough as ever.

00:11:28.236 --> 00:11:29.738
Still, what am I gonna do?

00:11:29.821 --> 00:11:32.449
| didn't bring a swimsuit, either.

00:11:32.532 --> 00:11:34.492
Not to worry.

00:11:34.576 --> 00:11:36.870
We have made arrangements over there.

00:11:40.582 --> 00:11:44.836
If I were to go in there right now,
| could die with no regrets.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.380
You'd die before you ever got that far, though.

00:11:47.464 --> 00:11:50.675
Those maids would shoot
you without a second thought.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.678
How about this one?

00:11:54.638 --> 00:11:56.306
Or there's this one.

00:11:57.349 --> 00:12:00.352
Ah, or this one.

00:12:00.435 --> 00:12:03.146
Hmm, maybe not this one.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:08.109
Miss Eris, how about this one?
It's cuter than the earlier ones.

00:12:08.193 --> 00:12:10.528
As long as we're here,
you want me to try it on?

00:12:10.612 --> 00:12:13.573
Amazing. These are all upscale brands.

00:12:13.657 --> 00:12:16.910
Say, is it okay if we borrow them, too?

00:12:18.119 --> 00:12:21.998
You can wear whatever you like,
as long as Miss Eris doesn't want to.

00:12:22.082 --> 00:12:23.041
Really?

00:12:23.124 --> 00:12:25.085
Thank you, Antonia!

00:12:27.337 --> 00:12:30.674
That one would be okay,
but it might be a little too subdued.

00:12:31.716 --> 00:12:33.969
That one's cute, but not really your style.

00:12:34.803 --> 00:12:38.223
Better yet, you might want to go with this.

00:12:38.306 --> 00:12:40.642
| don't really think I can...

00:12:40.725 --> 00:12:43.728
It's fine. Compared to
what you had to wear before,

00:12:43.812 --> 00:12:45.814
it's completely tame.

00:12:45.897 --> 00:12:47.691
| can't, I can't, I can't!

00:12:50.986 --> 00:12:53.071
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:53.154 --> 00:12:54.531
Kio!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.912
What do you think of this swimsuit?

00:13:00.996 --> 00:13:03.206
Uh, mm-hmm, it's pretty.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.250
What are you blushing for?

00:13:05.667 --> 00:13:08.211
Like I said, you've got to
wear something more amazing,

00:13:08.295 --> 00:13:10.297
or you're gonna lose him.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:14.050
This is the most that I can handle.

00:13:14.134 --> 00:13:18.430
That's my Eris! It's like flowers
are springing up on the beach!

00:13:18.513 --> 00:13:19.889
Ta-da!

00:13:21.599 --> 00:13:23.560
How do we look?

00:13:30.608 --> 00:13:32.569
Th-They're really lapping it up.

00:13:32.652 --> 00:13:35.822
| just might be a closet showstopper.

00:13:36.823 --> 00:13:39.909
Aiko! You've got yours on backward!

00:13:39.993 --> 00:13:42.871
The hole for Eris' tail is in the front!

00:13:44.122 --> 00:13:45.707
Which also means...

00:13:54.299 --> 00:13:56.009
Are these assless?

00:13:58.636 --> 00:14:01.723
| should have known
you'd pick this up quickly, Futaba.

00:14:02.932 --> 00:14:06.186
That's because you're
such a good teacher, Kakazu.

00:14:08.521 --> 00:14:09.814
Oh...

00:14:09.898 --> 00:14:12.317
...they're getting along fine, aren't they?

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:15.612
It's...

00:14:15.695 --> 00:14:17.572
...too late now, huh?

00:14:21.743 --> 00:14:24.079
It's delicious!

00:14:24.162 --> 00:14:26.373
The flavors of the
high-quality meats brought out

00:14:26.456 --> 00:14:28.958
by the simple seasonings are amazing!

00:14:29.042 --> 00:14:31.669
Miss Eris, here. Ahh...

00:14:31.753 --> 00:14:33.129
Ahh...

00:14:33.213 --> 00:14:37.300
This meat is incredible.
It must be super-high-grade.

00:14:37.384 --> 00:14:40.136
Teacher, you don't
have to wolf it down like that.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.472
Who's going to complain over
a side benefit like this?

00:14:42.555 --> 00:14:44.224
Here, Kakazu.

00:14:44.307 --> 00:14:46.017
Thank you, Futaba.

00:14:46.643 --> 00:14:51.189
Thanks for everything today,
Kakazu. You taught me a lot.

00:14:51.272 --> 00:14:53.274
Mm-mm, it's nothing.

00:14:54.234 --> 00:14:55.944
Um, Futaba...

00:14:56.027 --> 00:14:56.820
Yes?

00:14:56.903 --> 00:15:00.615
As it happens,
| have a favor to ask of you.

00:15:00.698 --> 00:15:02.242
Would you mind?

00:15:02.784 --> 00:15:07.038
I-Is it something that you
have to ask me right here and now?

00:15:07.122 --> 00:15:09.707
Huh? No, it's not like that.

00:15:09.791 --> 00:15:12.502
Well then, could we go for a little walk?

00:15:25.849 --> 00:15:27.767
The moon is pretty, huh?

00:15:27.851 --> 00:15:29.018
Yeah.

00:15:30.103 --> 00:15:32.564
The thing is, I have this favor.

00:15:33.398 --> 00:15:35.024
Y-You see,

00:15:35.108 --> 00:15:37.527
I've been kicking it around in my head a lot,

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:40.321
but Futaba, I think
you're the one who'd be best.

00:15:41.614 --> 00:15:44.576
Futaba, I think you're the only one...

00:15:46.703 --> 00:15:48.746
Kakazu...

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:52.041
Futaba, it's embarrassing
for me to ask this, but...

00:15:52.125 --> 00:15:53.710
Yes?

00:15:53.793 --> 00:15:55.253
| want you...

00:15:56.337 --> 00:15:59.048
...to teach me how to fight, too.

00:16:08.308 --> 00:16:10.268
It's finally complete, then?

00:16:13.438 --> 00:16:17.525
The new model of Unya,
one closer to a real Assistroid,

00:16:17.609 --> 00:16:18.568
Unatan.

00:16:18.651 --> 00:16:20.737
The lady is waiting for this. Hurry!

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:23.198
Yes, ma'am! Prepare for startup tests!

00:16:28.328 --> 00:16:29.954
Huh? Where's Aoi?

00:16:30.038 --> 00:16:33.041
Oh, she said she wanted
to be alone for a while.

00:16:33.124 --> 00:16:34.501
| wonder what's up.

00:16:34.584 --> 00:16:37.045
What did you say to Aoi?

00:16:42.175 --> 00:16:45.970
Yeah, right. I'm nothing
but a doll that fights.

00:16:49.557 --> 00:16:51.768
It's...

00:16:51.851 --> 00:16:53.228
...too late now.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.105
They'll be all gone if
you don't eat them quickly,

00:16:56.189 --> 00:16:57.982
so I brought you some.

00:16:58.608 --> 00:17:01.069
Huh? Where's Kio?

00:17:02.362 --> 00:17:04.822
Uh, Aoi, here!

00:17:06.449 --> 00:17:07.450
Despicable.

00:17:07.534 --> 00:17:10.245
Huh? But they're so delicious.

00:17:10.328 --> 00:17:11.913
| absolutely...

00:17:14.374 --> 00:17:15.750
...hate you!

00:17:16.751 --> 00:17:21.339
| hate you. Your big boobs,
your tight waist, your tall height,

00:17:21.422 --> 00:17:23.883
your being an alien
with kitty ears and a tail,

00:17:23.967 --> 00:17:26.010
and being so cute, and nice,

00:17:26.094 --> 00:17:29.889
and always...
being together with Kakazu...

00:17:29.973 --> 00:17:31.349
Aoi...

00:17:31.849 --> 00:17:38.731
You're horrible. I liked Kakazu
before you ever got here!

00:17:40.024 --> 00:17:44.279
But then... You're horrible,
just showing up out of nowhere...

00:17:44.362 --> 00:17:48.241
| don't know much about TV, or manga...

00:17:48.324 --> 00:17:53.663
...and when it comes to cooking...
and friends... I just can't win.

00:17:53.746 --> 00:17:57.625
Aoi, Kio is someone
very important to you, huh?

00:17:57.709 --> 00:17:58.751
That's right!

00:17:58.835 --> 00:18:02.005
| could get through any mission
because I knew Kakazu was there!

00:18:02.088 --> 00:18:07.343
| put up with it! I even gave
up that job for Kakazu's sake!

00:18:07.427 --> 00:18:09.596
Which is why... which is why...

00:18:13.099 --> 00:18:15.810
Then, you're just like me.

00:18:16.769 --> 00:18:20.440
| also feel at ease when I'm with Kio.

00:18:20.523 --> 00:18:23.276
| can relax, you might say.
It's like somehow,

00:18:23.359 --> 00:18:25.987
| feel like I'm in my favorite sunning spot.

00:18:27.238 --> 00:18:29.365
Me, too! Me, too!

00:18:29.449 --> 00:18:31.242
Yum!

00:18:31.326 --> 00:18:33.703
Wow, this is great meat.

00:18:33.786 --> 00:18:38.249
It's so tender,
and gushes with juices with every bite.

00:18:38.333 --> 00:18:40.418
This can't be less than ¥500 per gram.

00:18:40.501 --> 00:18:43.087
Um, who might you be?

00:18:43.171 --> 00:18:46.215
Pleasure to meet you. I'm Ichika.

00:18:46.299 --> 00:18:47.717
Ichika?

00:18:49.594 --> 00:18:51.512
It sure is nice being young, huh?

00:18:51.596 --> 00:18:55.391
He must be quite a lucky man,
to be this infatuated over.

00:18:55.475 --> 00:18:57.518
What are you...

00:18:57.602 --> 00:19:00.396
Oh...? Is that your boyfriend in trouble?

00:19:01.481 --> 00:19:02.857
Kio!

00:19:08.112 --> 00:19:09.906
Hang back a second.

00:19:12.992 --> 00:19:15.745
Enemy attack!
From the mountainside at two o'clock!

00:19:15.828 --> 00:19:18.790
All units, defensive positions!
Sara, move out!

00:19:18.873 --> 00:19:20.249
Copy!

00:19:30.385 --> 00:19:32.178
An old tire?

00:19:34.764 --> 00:19:35.890
That's my camera!

00:19:35.973 --> 00:19:37.600
Yun-fat, after them!

00:19:38.768 --> 00:19:40.144
Kio?!

00:19:47.402 --> 00:19:48.778
Guys!

00:19:49.487 --> 00:19:51.280
Kio, over there!

00:20:16.931 --> 00:20:20.351
What do you think you're
doing to my little ones?!

00:20:22.562 --> 00:20:23.813
"Forward!" "Charge!"

00:20:31.654 --> 00:20:33.030
Is everyone all right?

00:20:33.114 --> 00:20:34.657
Yes, more or less.

00:20:34.741 --> 00:20:36.451
Thank you, Futaba.

00:20:36.534 --> 00:20:38.119
What exactly was that?

00:20:38.202 --> 00:20:41.080
It was all thanks to these,
which I got from Ichika.

00:20:41.164 --> 00:20:42.540
Ichika?

00:20:44.375 --> 00:20:47.086
Looks like the Accel Form cards...

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.922
...functioned just right.

00:20:52.884 --> 00:20:55.762
Is this a homebrew catapult?

00:20:55.845 --> 00:20:58.931
It uses springs from a car's suspension,

00:20:59.015 --> 00:21:01.726
and a starter from a truck as a winch.

00:21:01.809 --> 00:21:03.978
Reminds me of the little ones

00:21:04.061 --> 00:21:06.856
that the dog people brought
aboard Antonia's ship earlier.

00:21:06.939 --> 00:21:09.484
Didn't they sink along with the ship?

00:21:09.567 --> 00:21:11.819
They must have moved here along the sea floor.

00:21:11.903 --> 00:21:13.362
Unlike the ones we have,

00:21:13.446 --> 00:21:15.323
they don't have the
ability to self-regenerate,

00:21:15.406 --> 00:21:17.116
so it looks like they gathered
some electrical equipment

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:18.576
and repaired themselves.

00:21:18.659 --> 00:21:21.120
That's why they were
trying to steal the cameras.

00:21:21.204 --> 00:21:22.997
You've got to hand it to them.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:27.418
Well, I guess there is someone
who doesn't leave their friends behind.

00:21:27.502 --> 00:21:29.003
Um, Futaba...

00:21:29.086 --> 00:21:30.630
Yes, Kakazu?

00:21:30.713 --> 00:21:33.132
| meant what I said yesterday.

00:21:34.091 --> 00:21:36.511
| want you to teach me how to fight.

00:21:36.594 --> 00:21:39.138
For times like what happened last night.

00:21:41.432 --> 00:21:44.519
"They were brilliant, admirable, and heroic.

00:21:44.602 --> 00:21:47.104
Though inorganic, worthy of praise are they.

00:21:47.188 --> 00:21:51.234
See that thou rebuke them not.
--Ichika"

00:21:51.317 --> 00:21:53.277
Huh? What is this?

00:22:02.662 --> 00:22:05.122
Whisked off to a world of dreams,

00:22:05.206 --> 00:22:08.125
don't hesitate, let's take off!

00:22:08.209 --> 00:22:13.589
I'm going to drop by

00:22:13.673 --> 00:22:16.259
to hang out with you

00:22:26.018 --> 00:22:31.274
All this excitement
can be found sitting in the sun

00:22:31.357 --> 00:22:36.404
Happy Sunshine,
something good is bound to happen

00:22:36.487 --> 00:22:42.034
Let's stick our happiness
into a bouncy rhythm

00:22:42.118 --> 00:22:48.374
and ride the lucky waves through summer

00:22:49.584 --> 00:22:52.086
Don't limit how far we can go

00:22:52.169 --> 00:22:55.047
| want to know how far it is

00:22:55.131 --> 00:22:59.969
Fluttering, touching, my heart is an airship

00:23:00.052 --> 00:23:02.555
Gather in the fun things

00:23:02.638 --> 00:23:05.516
and let them bloom ever brighter

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:11.022
My heart leaps at the sound

00:23:11.105 --> 00:23:14.066
of your voice

00:23:28.247 --> 00:23:32.001
A secret, hidden burning love.
A vanished, unforgettable love.

00:23:32.084 --> 00:23:36.130
Whether you bear small breasts
or large ones, he is the same person!

00:23:36.213 --> 00:23:38.841
Next time, "We Had a Duel.”

00:23:38.925 --> 00:23:41.886
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:47.433
"See you next time!"
